note addmm: o[M,N] = c[N] + a[M,K] @ b[K,N] (aten.addmm, beta 1, alpha 1, bias over rows), row-major
note f32. Each sum starts at the bias, is summed in f64 and rounded once to f32.
note The caller supplies const lines M K N MK KN MN before this text.
fn amdot c view f32 N a view f32 MK b view f32 KN i ulong j ulong to f64
s = f64 get c j
ia = mul i K
rb = j
for k ulong K
s = add s mul f64 get a ia f64 get b rb
ia = add ia 1
rb = add rb N
end
ret s
end
fn addmm c view f32 N a view f32 MK b view f32 KN o edit f32 MN to void
for i ulong M
for j ulong N
put o add mul i N j f32 amdot c a b i j
end
end
end
